   Reverse engineering, modified builds, and redistribution or sale without ELD's written permission are not permitted (sharing a link to the official release and unmodified distribution within your own organization are allowed). See TERMS.md for the full terms.

2. 앱은 "있는 그대로" 제공되며 보증이 없습니다. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.
   책임 제한은 TERMS.md 4조를 따릅니다.

